Before proving this result, we indicate how it gives the property CS3; namely, that $|J|<\rho_{3} n / \log (m)$, and $v=-\Phi_{J^{c}} \beta_{J^{c}}$ imply


\begin{equation*}
\left\|\beta_{J^{c}}\right\|_{1} \geq \eta_{3} / \sqrt{\log (m / n)} \cdot\|v\|_{1} . \tag{VII.7}
